kyo and Paris weather.\\n\\n## Constraints & Preferences\\n- First response should be one short sentence.\\n- Fetch Tokyo and Paris weather in parallel, in one step, then compare them in one sentence.\\n\\n## Progress\\n### Done\\n- [x] Retrieved Tokyo weather: clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h.\\n- [x] Queried Tokyo and Paris in parallel and gave a one-sentence comparison.\\n\\n### In Progress\\n- [ ] (none)\\n\\n### Blocked\\n- Paris weather was unavailable: “Weather service unavailable for Paris”.\\n\\n## Key Decisions\\n- **Report Paris as unavailable**: The weather service returned no Paris weather data.\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n1. No further steps requested.\\n\\n## Critical Context\\n- Tokyo result was consistent across both queries: clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h.\",\"logprobs\":[]}\n\nevent: response.content_part.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.content_part.done\",\"sequence_number\":276,\"item_id\":\"msg_01ea12a7e5a6a591016affdecc476c87d0ab0b9947de0ade01\",\"output_index\":1,\"content_index\":0,\"part\":{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"text\":\"## Goal\\n- Get current weather for Tokyo, then compare Tokyo and Paris weather.\\n\\n## Constraints & Preferences\\n- First response should be one short sentence.\\n- Fetch Tokyo and Paris weather in parallel, in one step, then compare them in one sentence.\\n\\n## Progress\\n### Done\\n- [x] Retrieved Tokyo weather: clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h.\\n- [x] Queried Tokyo and Paris in parallel and gave a one-sentence comparison.\\n\\n### In Progress\\n- [ ] (none)\\n\\n### Blocked\\n- Paris weather was unavailable: “Weather service unavailable for Paris”.\\n\\n## Key Decisions\\n- **Report Paris as unavailable**: The weather service returned no Paris weather data.\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n1. No further steps requested.\\n\\n## Critical Context\\n- Tokyo result was consistent across both queries: clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h.\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[]}}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"se